  "releaseNotes": "refactor(memory): rename GetBytesCount to SizeOf and optimize Trim with SIMD\n\n      - Rename `GetBytesCount` to `SizeOf` to match standard .NET API conventions.\n      - Remove UTF-8 encoding logic from `SizeOf<T>(ReadOnlySpan<T>)` to correctly represent actual memory buffer size.\n      - Optimize `Trim` using `SearchValues<byte>` and `IndexOfAnyExcept`/`LastIndexOfAnyExcept` for SIMD acceleration (~15x-20x throughput improvement).",
